## The underlying ideas

This work is built on top of concepts that are not ours. They are attributed
here, and that attribution should travel with any copy or adaptation.

**Sheahan's Wall** is the model of Peter Sheahan, author, speaker, and founder
of Karrikins Group.

**The four-part uniqueness exercise** (problem in one word, audience in one
phrase, message in one sentence, one primary revenue stream), and the naming of
Sheahan's Wall, come from Rory and AJ Vaden of Brand Builders Group.

**"Find your uniqueness and exploit it in the service of others"** is Larry
Winget's.

Nothing in this license grants any right in the trademarks, brands, courses,
curricula, or published materials of Peter Sheahan, Karrikins Group, Brand
Builders Group, Rory Vaden, AJ Vaden, or Larry Winget. This repository is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of them.

